 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Most places do keep tables for short notice, but it' worth checking with the restaurant before you go. That's a good backup plan. Many restaurants will still hold a table for you, especially if you call before you get there. Most places won't charge penalty, just the full price for one person if there's still someone else eating. It' fairer to the waiter too, who's still waiting on you. No worries. It' good to double check these things. Which restaurant are you thinking of going to tonight?",
